OL,4,CHundreds complain about I'm A          
OL,5,CCelebrity after Mariella Frostrup      
OL,6,Ccalled AJ Odudu 'aggressive'           
OL,7,GMore than 800 people have complained   
OL,8,Gto the media regulator about an        
OL,9,Gepisode of ITV reality show I'm A      
OL,10,GCelebrity... Get Me Out of Here! in    
OL,11,Gwhich Mariella Frostrup accused her    
OL,12,Gcampmate AJ Odudu of being             
OL,13,G"aggressive".                          
OL,15,FOfcom said 887 people had filed        
OL,16,Fcomplaints about Sunday's episode in   
OL,17,Frelation to "alleged bullying          
OL,18,Fbehaviour" by Frostrup towards Odudu.  
